            "description": "Same endpoint as step 2, with `role: \"host\"` and the separate host phone/code. Creates the user row AND an empty host_profiles row in one step, on first-ever verify for `hostPhone`.\n\nThis becomes your \"current session\" for the rest of the collection (it runs after the USER verify), so the Profile and Hosts folders below exercise the HOST-only endpoints successfully."
