            "description": "HOST accounts only. Sets the host's online/offline status, which immediately affects what shows up in `List Hosts` with `onlineOnly=true`.\n\nAlso broadcasts a `presence:update` Socket.io event — `{ hostId, isOnline }` — to every connected socket client. To see this live: connect a Socket.io client to `{{baseUrl}}` with `auth: { token: \"<accessToken>\" }` in the handshake and listen for `presence:update`. Postman's plain HTTP requests can't demonstrate the socket side of this — that part needs to be tested from an actual client (or a small script)."
